# CI belongs to the sibling remote

After you change CI in a sibling, wait for that remote's run — do not assume
green from a local smoke test.

| Change | Where to look |
| --- | --- |
| MassTrade Bitbucket Pipelines | the Bitbucket repo named in the MassTrade `mani.yaml` |
| pware GitHub Actions | that product's `.github/workflows/` (`gh` from that clone) |

```sh
gh run list --limit 5
gh run view <run-id> --log-failed
```

Do not mark pipeline work done without reading the failed logs. Do not
weaken a workflow to get green. Do not add GitHub Actions for MassTrade —
MassTrade stays on Bitbucket.
